Nova-App: Nova Browser
Nova-News: NovaOS-Website eingebaut: Startseite mit Neuigkeiten, allen Update-Details und Anleitungen – auch ohne Internet
Nova-News-En: NovaOS website built in: start page with news, all update details and guides – also offline
Description: Nova Browser - Firefox with the NovaOS settings
 Privacy, speed and stability settings of Nova Browser (Firefox ESR): tracker
 blocking, HTTPS-only mode, no telemetry, inactive tabs unloaded when memory is
 low, hardware video decoding and fewer disk writes. With the NovaOS website
 built in (/usr/share/novaos/website: start page, update details, guides). The
 Nova Store shows updates of this package as "Nova Browser" with "Aktualisieren".
